## Interface: 120007
## Title: Gloom's Hub
## Notes: Shared base for the Gloom addon suite — the tabbed Suite window, the shared design toolkit, and custom font/graphic media registration. Gloom's Auras, Bars, and Overlays plug tabs into it.
