# Embedded libraries — load FIRST. LibSharedMedia is where the Hub registers
# the suite's custom fonts/textures; needs LibStub + CallbackHandler first.
# LibDataBroker + LibDBIcon render the ONE suite minimap launcher.
# Local copies for dev (gitignored); the packager refetches at release time.
Libs\LibStub\LibStub.lua
Libs\CallbackHandler-1.0\CallbackHandler-1.0.lua
Libs\LibSharedMedia-3.0\LibSharedMedia-3.0.lua
Libs\LibDataBroker-1.1\LibDataBroker-1.1.lua
Libs\LibDBIcon-1.0\LibDBIcon-1.0.lua

# Load order (SUITE-PLAN §2.2): Core (namespace + DB + ST migration + events)
# → Skin (the LibGloomSkin-1.0 body: design tokens + widget toolkit)
# → Shell (the one Suite window: RegisterTab/Open/FocusTab + /gloom)
# → Media (LSM registration, resolver, catalog API + the Media tab)
# → MinimapButton (the ONE suite launcher — GS icon, opens last-used tab).
Core.lua
Skin.lua
Shell.lua
Media.lua
MinimapButton.lua
